  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISEM Multi Annual Programme Estimate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The MAPE aims to support the delivery of ISEM programme objects in teh areas of access, qualty and management of secondary education in Malawi. Specifically, activities under the MAPE will cover results; 2.1 on curriculum roll out, 2.3 teacher training, 3.1 governance and management of the sector, and 3.2 decentralization.</narrative>
  </description>
